    {
      "id": "72326ba4-3957-4e31-a4e6-f93384b893d3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Overview",
        "content": "## Contoso .NET APM lab \u2014 Profiler vs EDOT\n\n**Live layout:**\n- `ShipmentsWeb` \u2192 SharedPool + **Elastic APM profiler** (`agent.name=dotnet`) \u2192 `traces-apm*`\n- `TrackingApi-EDOT` \u2192 TrackingEdotPool + **EDOT** (`agent.name=opentelemetry/dotnet/elastic`) \u2192 `traces-generic.otel-default`\n\nBusiness spans: Fody weave (`app`/`business` or OTel `Internal` via `Contoso.Observability`).\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
      }
    },
