      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "w": 28,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Capability matrix",
        "content": "### Capability matrix\n\n| Dimension | Profiler (.NET APM agent) | EDOT (.NET) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Intake | APM server (`.apm`) | Managed OTLP (`.ingest`) |\n| Data stream | `traces-apm*` / dataset `apm` | `traces-*.otel*` / `generic.otel` |\n| HTTP server | APM transactions | OTel Server spans (AspNet instrumentation) |\n| SQL | `span.type=db` / mssql | SqlClient Client spans |\n| Business/Fody | `app` / `business` | `Internal` ActivitySource |\n| Stacktraces | Yes | Not available |\n| Central/dynamic config | Yes | Not available |\n| Span compression | Yes | Not implemented |\n| IIS model | COR profiler on pool | NuGet + TelemetryHttpModule; **separate pool** |\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
      }
    },
