      "config": {
        "title": "Overhead summary",
        "content": "### Weave / profiler overhead (10m @ 10 req/s k6)\n\n| Stage | med | p95 | checks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| B0 (no weave, no profiler) | 43.3ms | 101ms | 100% |\n| S1 (no weave + profiler) | 40.0ms | 101ms | 100% |\n| narrow (`*Service` only) | 46.8ms | 111ms | 100% |\n| broad (+ Pricing/CallChain/Repo) | 40.6ms | 111ms | 100% |\n\nSource: `results/overhead-table.md`\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
